  "description": "*\"Please ruin my unrequited love!\"* \n\nA romantic heroine desperately wants her unrequited love to never come true?! Cho-Hui, who wants to ruin her own crush, Si-Ho, who uses her secret as an excuse to propose a deal, and Lee-Tae, who has noticed Si-Ho's unrequited love. A whirlwind romance unfolds between three people bent on ruining each other's unrequited loves!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
